### 巨量百应数据接口测试
### 描述: 巨量百应数据更新/查询相关的API测试用例

### ========================================
### 公共变量定义
### ========================================

@baseUrl = http://localhost:6606/replay/words/oceanEngineData
@token = 16ab18d1cd224bc5875ab4ac4b1e557a
@contentType = application/json
@videoId = test-video-id-001

### ========================================
### 1. 巨量数据更新接口 - 正常场景（包含ROI、投放ROI金额、退款金额、整体消耗ROI、净成交ROI字段）
### ========================================
POST {{baseUrl}}/updateOceanEngine
Content-Type: {{contentType}}
token: {{token}}

{
  "videoId": "{{videoId}}",
  "secUid": "test-sec-uid",
  "totalWatchNum": 5000,
  "averageOnlineNum": 200,
  "averageResidenceTime": 120,
  "incrementFollowerCount": 50,
  "convertFanRate": 0.05,
  "interactionPercent": 0.12,
  "volume": 100000,
  "purchaseCount": 30,
  "customerUnitPrice": 3333.33,
  "uvValue": 2.5,
  "goodsConvertRate": 0.03,
  "gpm": 15000,
  "showWatchCntRatio": 0.65,
  "roi": 2.5,
  "launchRoiAmount": 5000.00,
  "refundAmount": 300.50,
  "overallCostRoi": 3.25,
  "netTransactionRoi": 2.80,
  "isTakeProduct": 1,
  "watchFlowList": [
    {"sourceName": "自然推荐", "proportion": 60.5},
    {"sourceName": "付费流量", "proportion": 39.5}
  ],
  "payFlowList": [
    {"sourceName": "自然推荐", "proportion": 45.0},
    {"sourceName": "付费流量", "proportion": 55.0}
  ]
}

### 验证要点:
### - 返回 R<Long>，包含数据看板ID
### - 数据库 tb_video_data_viewing_confuse 中对应记录的 roi=2.5, launch_roi_amount=5000.00, refund_amount=300.50, overall_cost_roi=3.25, net_transaction_roi=2.80

### ========================================
### 2. 巨量数据更新接口 - ROI/投放ROI金额/退款金额为空（兼容旧客户端）
### ========================================
POST {{baseUrl}}/updateOceanEngine
Content-Type: {{contentType}}
token: {{token}}

{
  "videoId": "{{videoId}}",
  "secUid": "test-sec-uid",
  "totalWatchNum": 3000,
  "averageOnlineNum": 100,
  "averageResidenceTime": 90,
  "incrementFollowerCount": 20,
  "volume": 50000,
  "purchaseCount": 15,
  "isTakeProduct": 1
}

### 验证要点:
### - 新字段为null时不影响接口正常运行
### - 数据库中 roi, launch_roi_amount, refund_amount, overall_cost_roi, net_transaction_roi 为 NULL

### ========================================
### 3. 巨量数据更新接口 - 缺少videoId（校验失败）
### ========================================
POST {{baseUrl}}/updateOceanEngine
Content-Type: {{contentType}}
token: {{token}}

{
  "secUid": "test-sec-uid",
  "roi": 1.8,
  "launchRoiAmount": 2000.00,
  "refundAmount": 100.00,
  "overallCostRoi": 1.5,
  "netTransactionRoi": 1.2
}

### 验证要点:
### - 返回错误提示 "视频id不能为空"

### ========================================
### 4. 巨量数据查询接口 - 验证返回中包含新字段
### ========================================
GET {{baseUrl}}/getOceanEngine?videoId={{videoId}}
token: {{token}}

### 验证要点:
### - 返回 R<OceanEngineDataVo>
### - dataJson 中应包含 roi、launchRoiAmount、refundAmount、overallCostRoi、netTransactionRoi 字段

### ========================================
### 5. 获取巨量数据上传预签名链接
### ========================================
GET {{baseUrl}}/getSignUploadUrl?videoId={{videoId}}
token: {{token}}

### 验证要点:
### - 返回 R<SignUploadUrlVo>，包含预签名上传链接
